	quest.5AAFD41FB606DA18.title: "&dLinking Tool"
	quest.5AB25AAEDAA965C4.quest_desc: [
		"Inside of the dark forest's &dCursed Garden&f labirinth, you'll find a corrupted plant that wants to eat your face."
